4n rooli ja selvit\u00e4 ep\u00e4ilytt\u00e4v\u00e4n kahvilan mysteeri. Soluttaudu, etsi todistusaineistoa, \u00e4l\u00e4k\u00e4 miss\u00e4\u00e4n nimess\u00e4 j\u00e4\u00e4 kiinni. \n\nPeli on tehty yhteisty\u00f6ss\u00e4 Metropolian kolmannen vuoden opiskelijoiden ja Ylen kanssa. \n\nLue lis\u00e4\u00e4: \nhttps://yle.fi/aihe/historia/kieltolaki \nhttp://gamesblogs.metropolia.fi/salakapakka/", "short_description": "Astu 1920-luvun Helsinkiin ja k\u00e4y tutkimaan salaper\u00e4ist\u00e4 mysteerikahvilaa."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3092869367412511", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162702_760613700793011_4081331521003192320_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=xgl6yj88PCEQ7kNvwGqHLFf&_nc_oc=AdqD92IDBN0jbigylqSN6Buy9Zi6SHYOcNq9fTVY9tzOQjeWjGsibmCfcJCfSntz7fk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSp_xlaVICaoMLSVGH1aNN9VoESO3tLJeaJ2x63PyM2wg&oe=6AF89494"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3052622228115034", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12386286_555864938090815_4744680728720048128_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=d5xAh-t3WioQ7kNvwFZk51Q&_nc_oc=AdoZxWdjqyKUlcvW7usrmAZoDJRLUmZx7Swg_7sbA9OkzeiTExeG97hlFV5f_3dEiJo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQDpo442K2ctk0smdGn0VT6QkX7tnwxU5ZNEWywBVnxyw&oe=6AF89972"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "635734543935653", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162754_583536608704930_1984236639773261824_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=sTyP_ut9ytYQ7kNvwF3_Qep&_nc_oc=AdqhJAZFbFDzoEMiZb_fE_vo2m2Kxk8clyVP6YW0ZRlYRCbpZYwHitrFUneeMbD-G4g&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSLZ1Zt0b-u9WMHO2KHxyHiYOkJvseT5yh0tu-6gndHOA&oe=6AF8A715"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.p